{"id":"y8-algorithms-l2","label":"L2: Selection in Cambridge Pseudocode","steps":[{"id":"do-now","label":"Do Now: Question 1","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-do-now","validatorKey":"y8l2_do_now_sequence","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Do Now: Follow the Sequence</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A quick recap before today's new instruction. A sequence runs one line at a time from top to bottom.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Quick reference</h3><p><strong>&lt;-</strong> stores the value on the right in the variable on the left.</p><p><strong>OUTPUT</strong> displays a value.</p></div><div class=\"lesson-code\"><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;Number &lt;- 8</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;Number &lt;- Number - 3</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">3&nbsp;&nbsp;OUTPUT Number</div></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><h3>Questions</h3><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-a\">(a) State the value stored in <strong>Number</strong> after line 1. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-a\" aria-label=\"Do Now part a\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-b\">(b) State the value stored in <strong>Number</strong> after line 2. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-b\" aria-label=\"Do Now part b\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-c\">(c) State the value displayed by line 3. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-c\" aria-label=\"Do Now part c\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-do-now-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 3 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y8l2-do-now-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"do-now-2","label":"Do Now: Question 2","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-do-now-2","validatorKey":"y8l2_do_now_sequence_2","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Do Now: Follow the Sequence</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">One extra line this time, an extra step to track before the output.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Quick reference</h3><p><strong>&lt;-</strong> stores the value on the right in the variable on the left.</p><p><strong>OUTPUT</strong> displays a value.</p></div><div class=\"lesson-code\"><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;Number &lt;- 6</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;Number &lt;- Number * 3</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">3&nbsp;&nbsp;Number &lt;- Number + 4</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">4&nbsp;&nbsp;OUTPUT Number</div></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><h3>Questions</h3><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-2-a\">(a) State the value stored in <strong>Number</strong> after line 1. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-2-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-a\" aria-label=\"Do Now 2 part a\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-2-b\">(b) State the value stored in <strong>Number</strong> after line 2. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-2-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-b\" aria-label=\"Do Now 2 part b\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-2-c\">(c) State the value stored in <strong>Number</strong> after line 3. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-2-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-c\" aria-label=\"Do Now 2 part c\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-2-d\">(d) State the value displayed by line 4. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-2-d\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-2-d\" aria-label=\"Do Now 2 part d\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-do-now-2-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 4 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y8l2-do-now-2-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"do-now-3","label":"Do Now: Question 3","type":"short-answer-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-do-now-3","validatorKey":"y8l2_do_now_sequence_3","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Do Now: Follow the Sequence</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">The hardest one, two variables that depend on each other.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Quick reference</h3><p><strong>&lt;-</strong> stores the value on the right in the variable on the left.</p><p><strong>OUTPUT</strong> displays a value.</p></div><div class=\"lesson-code\"><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">1&nbsp;&nbsp;A &lt;- 5</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">2&nbsp;&nbsp;B &lt;- 3</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">3&nbsp;&nbsp;A &lt;- A + B</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">4&nbsp;&nbsp;B &lt;- A * 2</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">5&nbsp;&nbsp;OUTPUT A</div><div class=\"lesson-code-line\">6&nbsp;&nbsp;OUTPUT B</div></div></div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><h3>Questions</h3><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-3-a\">(a) State the value of <strong>A</strong> after line 3. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-3-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-3-a\" aria-label=\"Do Now 3 part a\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-3-b\">(b) State the value of <strong>B</strong> after line 4. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-3-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-3-b\" aria-label=\"Do Now 3 part b\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-3-c\">(c) State the value displayed by line 5. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-3-c\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-3-c\" aria-label=\"Do Now 3 part c\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y8l2-do-now-3-d\">(d) State the value displayed by line 6. [1]</label><input id=\"y8l2-do-now-3-d\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"do-now-3-d\" aria-label=\"Do Now 3 part d\" inputmode=\"numeric\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-do-now-3-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 4 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y8l2-do-now-3-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"title","label":"Selection in Cambridge Pseudocode","content":"<div class=\"lesson-title-slide\"><p class=\"lesson-title-kicker\">Algorithms</p><h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Selection in Cambridge Pseudocode</h2><p>Year 8</p></div>"},{"id":"commands","label":"Four Selection Instructions","type":"stepper","stepperId":"y8l2-commands-stepper","stepperKey":"cambridge_selection_commands","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Four Selection Instructions</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A sequence always runs every line. Selection is different, it chooses which lines to run.</p><div id=\"y8l2-commands-stepper\" class=\"lesson-stepper\"></div>"},{"id":"worked-trace","label":"Worked Trace Table","type":"stepper","stepperId":"y8l2-trace-stepper","stepperKey":"cambridge_selection_trace","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Worked Trace Table</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">For this run, the user enters <strong>13</strong>. A line that is skipped gets no row at all.</p><div id=\"y8l2-trace-stepper\" class=\"lesson-stepper\"></div>"},{"id":"trace-walkthrough","label":"Trace Table Walkthrough","type":"app-link","buttonId":"y8l2-walkthrough-btn","appId":"trace-table-practice","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Trace Table Walkthrough</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Complete a guided selection before working independently.</p><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Steps</h3><ol><li>Open Trace Tables.</li><li>At the top of the page, select <strong>Cambridge pseudocode</strong>.</li><li>Open <strong>Walkthrough</strong> and choose <strong>Selection</strong>.</li><li>Predict which branch will run before pressing Step Forward.</li><li>Press Step Forward until the table is complete.</li></ol><p><strong>Complete when:</strong> the table shows the input, the branch that ran, and the program output.</p></div><div class=\"lesson-app-link\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-walkthrough-btn\">Open Trace Tables</button></div>"},{"id":"write-selection","label":"Turn Instructions into Pseudocode","type":"stepper","stepperId":"y8l2-writing-stepper","stepperKey":"cambridge_write_selection","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Turn Instructions into Pseudocode</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">The task is to receive a temperature, then output \"Warm\" or \"Cool\" depending on its value.</p><div id=\"y8l2-writing-stepper\" class=\"lesson-stepper\"></div>"},{"id":"write-practice","label":"Write It Yourself","type":"pseudocode-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-write-practice","validatorKey":"y8l2_write_practice","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Write It Yourself</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Use the same structure you just learned, but write it yourself this time.</p><div class=\"lesson-profile-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Task</h3><p>Write pseudocode for an algorithm that:</p><ul><li>asks for the <strong>Score</strong></li><li>outputs <strong>\"Pass\"</strong> if Score is 50 or more</li><li>outputs <strong>\"Fail\"</strong> otherwise</li></ul></div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Remember</h3><ul><li>Use <strong>INPUT</strong> to receive a value.</li><li>Use <strong>IF ... THEN</strong> to write the condition.</li><li>Use <strong>ELSE</strong> for the other branch, no condition of its own.</li><li>Close the block with <strong>ENDIF</strong>.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pseudocode-check\"><label for=\"y8l2-write-practice-code\"><strong>Your pseudocode</strong></label><textarea id=\"y8l2-write-practice-code\" class=\"lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-id=\"write-practice-pseudocode\" aria-label=\"Write it yourself pseudocode\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><div class=\"pseudocode-output-row\"><label for=\"y8l2-write-practice-output\">If Score is 42, what would your algorithm display?</label><input id=\"y8l2-write-practice-output\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"write-practice-output\" aria-label=\"Write it yourself output\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-write-practice-check\">Check my answer</button><div id=\"y8l2-write-practice-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"trace-practice","label":"Independent Trace Table Practice","type":"app-link","buttonId":"y8l2-practice-btn","appId":"trace-table-practice","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Independent Trace Table Practice</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Use each line of code to decide which trace table cell changes.</p><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Required work</h3><ol><li>Select <strong>Cambridge pseudocode</strong>.</li><li>Open <strong>Practice</strong>, choose <strong>Selection</strong>, and complete <strong>Selection Foundations</strong>.</li><li>Use <strong>Check Answers</strong>. Correct your table until it shows <strong>Perfect</strong>.</li><li>Open the <strong>Auto-Generator</strong>, choose <strong>Selection</strong> and <strong>Easy</strong>.</li><li>Complete one generated question correctly.</li></ol><p><strong>Complete when:</strong> Selection Foundations shows Perfect and one generated Selection question has been answered correctly. Progress is saved to your account.</p></div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Once you are confident</h3><p>Switch the toggle at the top of Trace Tables from creating a trace table to writing pseudocode, then select Selection. Read the trace table you are given, check the hint for each line, then write the matching program.</p></div><div class=\"lesson-app-link\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-practice-btn\">Open Trace Tables</button></div>"},{"id":"write-practice-2","label":"One More Rule to Write","type":"pseudocode-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-write-practice-2","validatorKey":"y8l2_write_practice_2","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">One More Rule to Write</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A different scenario, the same structure.</p><div class=\"lesson-profile-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Task</h3><p>Write pseudocode for an algorithm that:</p><ul><li>asks for the <strong>Age</strong></li><li>outputs <strong>\"Junior\"</strong> if Age is under 13</li><li>outputs <strong>\"Senior\"</strong> otherwise</li></ul></div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Remember</h3><ul><li>Use <strong>INPUT</strong> to receive a value.</li><li>Use <strong>IF ... THEN</strong> to write the condition.</li><li>Use <strong>ELSE</strong> for the other branch.</li><li>Close the block with <strong>ENDIF</strong>.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pseudocode-check\"><label for=\"y8l2-write-practice-2-code\"><strong>Your pseudocode</strong></label><textarea id=\"y8l2-write-practice-2-code\" class=\"lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-id=\"write-practice-2-pseudocode\" aria-label=\"One more rule pseudocode\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><div class=\"pseudocode-output-row\"><label for=\"y8l2-write-practice-2-output\">If Age is 10, what would your algorithm display?</label><input id=\"y8l2-write-practice-2-output\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"write-practice-2-output\" aria-label=\"One more rule output\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-write-practice-2-check\">Check my answer</button><div id=\"y8l2-write-practice-2-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"plenary","label":"Plenary: Question 1","type":"pseudocode-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-plenary","validatorKey":"y8l2_plenary","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Plenary</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Use everything from today. Try this on your own before checking your answer.</p><div class=\"lesson-profile-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Task</h3><p>Write pseudocode for an algorithm that:</p><ul><li>asks for the <strong>Height</strong></li><li>outputs <strong>\"Tall\"</strong> if Height is 150 or more</li><li>outputs <strong>\"Short\"</strong> otherwise</li></ul></div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Remember</h3><ul><li>Use <strong>INPUT</strong> to receive a value.</li><li>Use <strong>IF ... THEN</strong> to write the condition.</li><li>Use <strong>ELSE</strong> for the other branch.</li><li>Close the block with <strong>ENDIF</strong>.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pseudocode-check\"><label for=\"y8l2-plenary-code\"><strong>Your pseudocode</strong></label><textarea id=\"y8l2-plenary-code\" class=\"lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-id=\"plenary-pseudocode\" aria-label=\"Plenary pseudocode\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><div class=\"pseudocode-output-row\"><label for=\"y8l2-plenary-output\">If Height is 160, what would your algorithm display?</label><input id=\"y8l2-plenary-output\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"plenary-output\" aria-label=\"Plenary output\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-plenary-check\">Check my answer</button><div id=\"y8l2-plenary-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"plenary-2","label":"Plenary: Question 2","type":"pseudocode-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-plenary-2","validatorKey":"y8l2_plenary_2","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Plenary</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Harder than Question 1, work out a value first, then test it.</p><div class=\"lesson-profile-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Task</h3><p>Write pseudocode for an algorithm that:</p><ul><li>asks for the <strong>Price</strong> and the <strong>Quantity</strong></li><li>works out the <strong>Total</strong> (Price times Quantity)</li><li>outputs <strong>\"Free Delivery\"</strong> if Total is 50 or more</li><li>outputs <strong>\"Delivery Charge Applies\"</strong> otherwise</li></ul></div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Remember</h3><ul><li>Use <strong>INPUT</strong> for each value you receive.</li><li>Work out Total before you test it.</li><li>Use <strong>IF ... THEN</strong> to write the condition.</li><li>Use <strong>ELSE</strong> for the other branch, then close with <strong>ENDIF</strong>.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pseudocode-check\"><label for=\"y8l2-plenary-2-code\"><strong>Your pseudocode</strong></label><textarea id=\"y8l2-plenary-2-code\" class=\"lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-id=\"plenary-2-pseudocode\" aria-label=\"Plenary 2 pseudocode\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><div class=\"pseudocode-output-row\"><label for=\"y8l2-plenary-2-output\">If Price is 10 and Quantity is 6, what would your algorithm display?</label><input id=\"y8l2-plenary-2-output\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"plenary-2-output\" aria-label=\"Plenary 2 output\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-plenary-2-check\">Check my answer</button><div id=\"y8l2-plenary-2-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"},{"id":"plenary-3","label":"Plenary: Question 3","type":"pseudocode-validation","validatorId":"y8l2-plenary-3","validatorKey":"y8l2_plenary_3","content":"<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Plenary</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">The hardest one, three values to receive and a longer calculation before the condition.</p><div class=\"lesson-profile-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Task</h3><p>Write pseudocode for an algorithm that:</p><ul><li>asks for <strong>NumA</strong>, <strong>NumB</strong> and <strong>NumC</strong></li><li>works out the <strong>Total</strong> of all three</li><li>outputs <strong>\"High\"</strong> if Total is 100 or more</li><li>outputs <strong>\"Low\"</strong> otherwise</li></ul></div><div class=\"lesson-flow-task\"><h3>Remember</h3><ul><li>Use <strong>INPUT</strong> for each value you receive.</li><li>Work out Total before you test it.</li><li>Use <strong>IF ... THEN</strong> to write the condition.</li><li>Use <strong>ELSE</strong> for the other branch, then close with <strong>ENDIF</strong>.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pseudocode-check\"><label for=\"y8l2-plenary-3-code\"><strong>Your pseudocode</strong></label><textarea id=\"y8l2-plenary-3-code\" class=\"lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-id=\"plenary-3-pseudocode\" aria-label=\"Plenary 3 pseudocode\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><div class=\"pseudocode-output-row\"><label for=\"y8l2-plenary-3-output\">If NumA is 40, NumB is 35 and NumC is 30, what would your algorithm display?</label><input id=\"y8l2-plenary-3-output\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"plenary-3-output\" aria-label=\"Plenary 3 output\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y8l2-plenary-3-check\">Check my answer</button><div id=\"y8l2-plenary-3-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div>"}],"validators":{"y8l2_do_now_sequence":[{"suffix":"a","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*8\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (a)."},{"suffix":"b","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*5\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (b)."},{"suffix":"c","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*5\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (c)."}],"y8l2_do_now_sequence_2":[{"suffix":"a","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*6\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (a)."},{"suffix":"b","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*18\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (b)."},{"suffix":"c","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*22\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (c)."},{"suffix":"d","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*22\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (d)."}],"y8l2_do_now_sequence_3":[{"suffix":"a","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*8\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (a)."},{"suffix":"b","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*16\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (b)."},{"suffix":"c","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*8\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (c)."},{"suffix":"d","pattern":{"__regex":true,"source":"^\\s*16\\s*$","flags":""},"feedback":"Check part (d)."}]},"pseudocodeValidators":{"y8l2_write_practice":{"lines":[{"code":"INPUT SCORE","feedback":"Line 1 must input Score."},{"code":"IF SCORE >= 50 THEN","feedback":"Line 2 must test whether Score is 50 or more."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"PASS\"","feedback":"Line 3 must output \"Pass\"."},{"code":"ELSE","feedback":"Line 4 must be ELSE, no condition of its own."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"FAIL\"","feedback":"Line 5 must output \"Fail\"."},{"code":"ENDIF","feedback":"Line 6 must close the IF block with ENDIF."}],"output":"fail"},"y8l2_write_practice_2":{"lines":[{"code":"INPUT AGE","feedback":"Line 1 must input Age."},{"code":"IF AGE < 13 THEN","feedback":"Line 2 must test whether Age is under 13."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"JUNIOR\"","feedback":"Line 3 must output \"Junior\"."},{"code":"ELSE","feedback":"Line 4 must be ELSE, no condition of its own."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"SENIOR\"","feedback":"Line 5 must output \"Senior\"."},{"code":"ENDIF","feedback":"Line 6 must close the IF block with ENDIF."}],"output":"junior"},"y8l2_plenary":{"lines":[{"code":"INPUT HEIGHT","feedback":"Line 1 must input Height."},{"code":"IF HEIGHT >= 150 THEN","feedback":"Line 2 must test whether Height is 150 or more."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"TALL\"","feedback":"Line 3 must output \"Tall\"."},{"code":"ELSE","feedback":"Line 4 must be ELSE, no condition of its own."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"SHORT\"","feedback":"Line 5 must output \"Short\"."},{"code":"ENDIF","feedback":"Line 6 must close the IF block with ENDIF."}],"output":"tall"},"y8l2_plenary_2":{"lines":[{"code":"INPUT PRICE","feedback":"Line 1 must input Price."},{"code":"INPUT QUANTITY","feedback":"Line 2 must input Quantity."},{"code":"TOTAL <- PRICE * QUANTITY","feedback":"Line 3 must calculate Price * Quantity and assign the result to Total using <-."},{"code":"IF TOTAL >= 50 THEN","feedback":"Line 4 must test whether Total is 50 or more."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"FREE DELIVERY\"","feedback":"Line 5 must output \"Free Delivery\"."},{"code":"ELSE","feedback":"Line 6 must be ELSE, no condition of its own."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"DELIVERY CHARGE APPLIES\"","feedback":"Line 7 must output \"Delivery Charge Applies\"."},{"code":"ENDIF","feedback":"Line 8 must close the IF block with ENDIF."}],"output":"free delivery"},"y8l2_plenary_3":{"lines":[{"code":"INPUT NUMA","feedback":"Line 1 must input NumA."},{"code":"INPUT NUMB","feedback":"Line 2 must input NumB."},{"code":"INPUT NUMC","feedback":"Line 3 must input NumC."},{"code":"TOTAL <- NUMA + NUMB + NUMC","feedback":"Line 4 must add all three numbers and assign the result to Total using <-."},{"code":"IF TOTAL >= 100 THEN","feedback":"Line 5 must test whether Total is 100 or more."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"HIGH\"","feedback":"Line 6 must output \"High\"."},{"code":"ELSE","feedback":"Line 7 must be ELSE, no condition of its own."},{"code":"OUTPUT \"LOW\"","feedback":"Line 8 must output \"Low\"."},{"code":"ENDIF","feedback":"Line 9 must close the IF block with ENDIF."}],"output":"high"}}}